{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave \u00d7 Junction is an RPG where you battle monsters in a back-and-forth contest of blackjack, the playing card game familiar to many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the monsters and delve dungeons. A fun tale of adventure all while being simple to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2013Game Features\u2013</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbBlackjack Style Turn-Based Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/8e8a4a7a2a1810e4563d5dd416d79995.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are a one-on-one turn-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who has the closest number to 21 in their hand? They deal an attack to the opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three distinctive playable characters make an appearance: The Fighter, with a head on battle-like creed; the Thief, unrivaled in sensing danger and thwarting it; and the Magician, who employs trickery at will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your strategy to chance? Entrap the enemy with trickery? The way you enjoy is up to you, the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbDiverse Array of Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/4e0633ab5d69d0fc915197660350af51.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes, orcs, dragons, and monsters, familiar to fantasy RPGs all lurk out of the depths, one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card hand concealing ghosts, trolls that surpass the 21-card value limit, and many more with a diverse array of skills stand in the way of the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters from Rideon Japan's \u201cAdventure Bar Story\u201d and \u201cMercenaries Saga\u201d series games even make an appearance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbLoads of Factors to Augment, Unfolding a Blackjack Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/6b3de9ec8e1071211768d07d1da2a683.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire boost cards as you advance the adventure, strengthening status and learning skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities come along with some weapons and accessories, and at the Armory &amp; Forge in town, synthesis can allow for unbound customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining skills with abilities? This could bring to life new tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you traverse the untrodden dungeons? It's all up to you, the player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbOther</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the title of this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players outside the Japanese region, please Advanced Search for &quot;Brave X Junction&quot; or &quot;Brave x Junction&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playing card designs feature characters from our games &quot;Mercenaries Wings&quot;, &quot;Mercenaries Blaze&quot;, &quot;Mercenaries Rebirth&quot;, and &quot;Mercenaries Lament&quot;.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Brave \u00d7 Junction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/fbc0664aa38493b85cf030d48d2febf366170471.jpg"},{"name":"Waking of a Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/fc5d9fc283bf7badf969478b95b90d150336afb7.jpg"},{"name":"Rosehedge Quarry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/fc5d9fc283bf7badf969478b95b90d150336afb7.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Ruins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/fc5d9fc283bf7badf969478b95b90d150336afb7.jpg"},{"name":"Azure Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/fc5d9fc283bf7badf969478b95b90d150336afb7.jpg"},{"name":"Crystal Hollow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/69a3657e6d91c86ab31769e8e55fe31a6ffbe093.jpg"},{"name":"Know it All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/d45575527813cec052a15094f778c49cff383c0d.jpg"},{"name":"Card Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/fc5d9fc283bf7badf969478b95b90d150336afb7.jpg"},{"name":"Card Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/fc5d9fc283bf7badf969478b95b90d150336afb7.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3364830/69a3657e6d91c86ab31769e8e55fe31a6ffbe093.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364830?t=1761792774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/d5456022fa65afd7a48f884cd27df1f3924e0ca2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761792774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/b777645fabbb3a09e826b4f9743bb41a13e168a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761792774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/b777645fabbb3a09e826b4f9743bb41a13e168a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761792774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc