s=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card hand concealing ghosts, trolls that surpass the 21-card value limit, and many more with a diverse array of skills stand in the way of the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters from Rideon Japan's \u201cAdventure Bar Story\u201d and \u201cMercenaries Saga\u201d series games even make an appearance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbLoads of Factors to Augment, Unfolding a Blackjack Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/extras/6b3de9ec8e1071211768d07d1da2a683.avif?t=1761792774\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire boost cards as you advance the adventure, strengthening status and learning skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities come along with some weapons and accessories, and at the Armory &amp; Forge in town, synthesis can allow for unbound customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining skills with abilities? This could bring to life new tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you traverse the untrodden dungeons? It's all up to you, the player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbOther</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the title of this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players outside the Japanese region, please Advanced Search for &quot;Brave X Junction&quot; or &quot;Brave x Junction&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playing card designs feature characters from our games &quot;Mercenaries Wings&quot;, &quot;Mercenaries Blaze&quot;, &quot;Mercenaries Rebirth&quot;, and &quot;Mercenaries Lament&quot;.</p>","developers":["Rideon,Inc.","RideonJapan"],"dlc":[4024090],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364830/8a28a3bf0858365e98c8237ca